{"id":"a6d483dd2c6fd176","group":"89","path":"89/89-df-bimodal-formula.md","title":"Bimodal Formula","display":"df-bimodal-formula — Bimodal Formula","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-df-bimodal-formula","aliases":["89-df-bimodal-formula"],"display":"df-bimodal-formula — Bimodal Formula","depends_on":["[[89-df-modal-formula]]","[[89-df-function]]"],"created":"2026-10-05","revised":"2026-10-09"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-df-bimodal-formula"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-df-bimodal-formula</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-bimodal-formula — Bimodal Formula"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"56c1b5b75a32ca1d\" href=\"?note=56c1b5b75a32ca1d\" title=\"89-df-modal-formula\">89-df-modal-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0d71e87a2f416230\" href=\"?note=0d71e87a2f416230\" title=\"89-df-function\">89-df-function</a></span></div>"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-05"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-09"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>使用相同字母集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prop}\">\\(\\mathrm{Prop}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot,\\neg,\\land,\\Box_0,\\Box_1\">\\(\\bot,\\neg,\\land,\\Box_0,\\Box_1\\)</span> 为自由构造子，像与字母集及彼此不交。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\\in\\{0,1\\}\">\\(i\\in\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\">\\(A,B\\)</span> 为下述双模态公式。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho:\\mathrm{Prop}\\to\\mathrm{Fml}_{0,1}\">\\(\\rho:\\mathrm{Prop}\\to\\mathrm{Fml}_{0,1}\\)</span>；单字母替换 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[p:=C]\">\\([p:=C]\\)</span> 取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho(p)=C\">\\(\\rho(p)=C\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho(q)=q\">\\(\\rho(q)=q\\)</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q\\ne p\">\\(q\\ne p\\)</span>）。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi\">\\(\\pi\\)</span> 使用本书自然数配对；排序按下述 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g_B\">\\(g_B\\)</span> 升序且无重复。</li>\n<li>布尔缩写及有限折叠属于双模态语法，不调用单模态公式域外的函数。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}bimodal\\text{-}formula}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\nB_0&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Prop}\\cup\\{\\bot\\},\\\\\nB_{n+1}&amp;\\coloneqq B_n\\cup\n\\{\\neg A,\\Box_0A,\\Box_1A\\mid A\\in B_n\\}\n\\cup\\{A\\land C\\mid A,C\\in B_n\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Fml}_{0,1}&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}B_n\\\\\n\\top&amp;\\coloneqq\\neg\\bot,\\quad A\\lor B\\coloneqq\\neg(\\neg A\\land\\neg B),\\quad\nA\\to B\\coloneqq\\neg(A\\land\\neg B),\\quad A\\leftrightarrow B\\coloneqq(A\\to B)\\land(B\\to A),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Var}_B(p)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{p\\},\\quad\\mathrm{Var}_B(\\bot)\\coloneqq\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\mathrm{Var}_B(\\neg A)=\\mathrm{Var}_B(\\Box_iA)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Var}_B(A),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Var}_B(A\\land B)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Var}_B(A)\\cup\\mathrm{Var}_B(B),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Sub}_B(p)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{p\\},\\quad\\mathrm{Sub}_B(\\bot)\\coloneqq\\{\\bot\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Sub}_B(\\neg A)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\neg A\\}\\cup\\mathrm{Sub}_B(A),\\quad\n\\mathrm{Sub}_B(\\Box_iA)\\coloneqq\\{\\Box_iA\\}\\cup\\mathrm{Sub}_B(A),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Sub}_B(A\\land B)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{A\\land B\\}\\cup\\mathrm{Sub}_B(A)\\cup\\mathrm{Sub}_B(B),\\\\\n\\widehat\\rho_B(p)&amp;\\coloneqq\\rho(p),\\quad\\widehat\\rho_B(\\bot)\\coloneqq\\bot,\\quad\n\\widehat\\rho_B(\\neg A)\\coloneqq\\neg\\widehat\\rho_B(A),\\\\\n\\widehat\\rho_B(A\\land B)&amp;\\coloneqq\\widehat\\rho_B(A)\\land\\widehat\\rho_B(B),\\quad\n\\widehat\\rho_B(\\Box_iA)\\coloneqq\\Box_i\\widehat\\rho_B(A),\\quad A[\\rho]\\coloneqq\\widehat\\rho_B(A),\\\\\ng_B(\\bot)&amp;\\coloneqq0,\\quad g_B(p_i)\\coloneqq6i+1,\\quad g_B(\\neg A)\\coloneqq6g_B(A)+2,\\\\\ng_B(A\\land B)&amp;\\coloneqq6\\pi(g_B(A),g_B(B))+3,\\quad\ng_B(\\Box_0A)\\coloneqq6g_B(A)+4,\\quad g_B(\\Box_1A)\\coloneqq6g_B(A)+5,\\\\\n\\operatorname{sort}_B(E)&amp;\\coloneqq s\\quad(E\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathrm{Fml}_{0,1}),\\ s\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{0,1}^{&lt;\\omega},\\\n\\operatorname{ran}(s)=E,\\ \\forall i&lt;j&lt;|s|\\ g_B(s_i)&lt;g_B(s_j)),\\\\\n\\bigwedge\\langle\\rangle&amp;\\coloneqq\\top,\\quad\\bigwedge(s\\mathbin{\\frown}\\langle A\\rangle)\\coloneqq(\\bigwedge s)\\land A,\\\\\n\\bigvee\\langle\\rangle&amp;\\coloneqq\\bot,\\quad\\bigvee(s\\mathbin{\\frown}\\langle A\\rangle)\\coloneqq(\\bigvee s)\\lor A\\\\\n\\rho_{p,C}(q)&amp;\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}C,&amp;q=p,\\\\q,&amp;q\\ne p,\\end{cases}\\quad(p,q\\in\\mathrm{Prop},\\ C\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{0,1}),\\\\\nA[p:=C]&amp;\\coloneqq A[\\rho_{p,C}].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}bimodal\\text{-}formula}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\nB_0&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Prop}\\cup\\{\\bot\\},\\\\\nB_{n+1}&amp;\\coloneqq B_n\\cup\n\\{\\neg A,\\Box_0A,\\Box_1A\\mid A\\in B_n\\}\n\\cup\\{A\\land C\\mid A,C\\in B_n\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Fml}_{0,1}&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}B_n\\\\\n\\top&amp;\\coloneqq\\neg\\bot,\\quad A\\lor B\\coloneqq\\neg(\\neg A\\land\\neg B),\\quad\nA\\to B\\coloneqq\\neg(A\\land\\neg B),\\quad A\\leftrightarrow B\\coloneqq(A\\to B)\\land(B\\to A),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Var}_B(p)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{p\\},\\quad\\mathrm{Var}_B(\\bot)\\coloneqq\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\mathrm{Var}_B(\\neg A)=\\mathrm{Var}_B(\\Box_iA)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Var}_B(A),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Var}_B(A\\land B)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Var}_B(A)\\cup\\mathrm{Var}_B(B),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Sub}_B(p)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{p\\},\\quad\\mathrm{Sub}_B(\\bot)\\coloneqq\\{\\bot\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Sub}_B(\\neg A)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\neg A\\}\\cup\\mathrm{Sub}_B(A),\\quad\n\\mathrm{Sub}_B(\\Box_iA)\\coloneqq\\{\\Box_iA\\}\\cup\\mathrm{Sub}_B(A),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Sub}_B(A\\land B)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{A\\land B\\}\\cup\\mathrm{Sub}_B(A)\\cup\\mathrm{Sub}_B(B),\\\\\n\\widehat\\rho_B(p)&amp;\\coloneqq\\rho(p),\\quad\\widehat\\rho_B(\\bot)\\coloneqq\\bot,\\quad\n\\widehat\\rho_B(\\neg A)\\coloneqq\\neg\\widehat\\rho_B(A),\\\\\n\\widehat\\rho_B(A\\land B)&amp;\\coloneqq\\widehat\\rho_B(A)\\land\\widehat\\rho_B(B),\\quad\n\\widehat\\rho_B(\\Box_iA)\\coloneqq\\Box_i\\widehat\\rho_B(A),\\quad A[\\rho]\\coloneqq\\widehat\\rho_B(A),\\\\\ng_B(\\bot)&amp;\\coloneqq0,\\quad g_B(p_i)\\coloneqq6i+1,\\quad g_B(\\neg A)\\coloneqq6g_B(A)+2,\\\\\ng_B(A\\land B)&amp;\\coloneqq6\\pi(g_B(A),g_B(B))+3,\\quad\ng_B(\\Box_0A)\\coloneqq6g_B(A)+4,\\quad g_B(\\Box_1A)\\coloneqq6g_B(A)+5,\\\\\n\\operatorname{sort}_B(E)&amp;\\coloneqq s\\quad(E\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathrm{Fml}_{0,1}),\\ s\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{0,1}^{&lt;\\omega},\\\n\\operatorname{ran}(s)=E,\\ \\forall i&lt;j&lt;|s|\\ g_B(s_i)&lt;g_B(s_j)),\\\\\n\\bigwedge\\langle\\rangle&amp;\\coloneqq\\top,\\quad\\bigwedge(s\\mathbin{\\frown}\\langle A\\rangle)\\coloneqq(\\bigwedge s)\\land A,\\\\\n\\bigvee\\langle\\rangle&amp;\\coloneqq\\bot,\\quad\\bigvee(s\\mathbin{\\frown}\\langle A\\rangle)\\coloneqq(\\bigvee s)\\lor A\\\\\n\\rho_{p,C}(q)&amp;\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}C,&amp;q=p,\\\\q,&amp;q\\ne p,\\end{cases}\\quad(p,q\\in\\mathrm{Prop},\\ C\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{0,1}),\\\\\nA[p:=C]&amp;\\coloneqq A[\\rho_{p,C}].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Boolos, <em>The Logic of Provability</em>，第 15 章，印刷页 187–188；PDF 页码为印刷页加 39。本条采用本目录的等价语法约定。\n单模态语言嵌入此语言时将 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box\">\\(\\Box\\)</span> 送到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box_0\">\\(\\Box_0\\)</span>。两个构造子自由生成，不能把元语言的不同证明关系直接当作同一盒。子公式、变元集、替换按有限语法树递归扩展。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-modal-formula","status":"resolved","id":"56c1b5b75a32ca1d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-modal-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"0d71e87a2f416230","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-function]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{Prop}","display":false},{"tex":"\\bot,\\neg,\\land,\\Box_0,\\Box_1","display":false},{"tex":"i\\in\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"A,B","display":false},{"tex":"\\rho:\\mathrm{Prop}\\to\\mathrm{Fml}_{0,1}","display":false},{"tex":"[p:=C]","display":false},{"tex":"\\rho(p)=C","display":false},{"tex":"\\rho(q)=q","display":false},{"tex":"q\\ne p","display":false},{"tex":"\\pi","display":false},{"tex":"g_B","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}bimodal\\text{-}formula}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\nB_0&\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Prop}\\cup\\{\\bot\\},\\\\\nB_{n+1}&\\coloneqq B_n\\cup\n\\{\\neg A,\\Box_0A,\\Box_1A\\mid A\\in B_n\\}\n\\cup\\{A\\land C\\mid A,C\\in B_n\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Fml}_{0,1}&\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}B_n\\\\\n\\top&\\coloneqq\\neg\\bot,\\quad A\\lor B\\coloneqq\\neg(\\neg A\\land\\neg B),\\quad\nA\\to B\\coloneqq\\neg(A\\land\\neg B),\\quad A\\leftrightarrow B\\coloneqq(A\\to B)\\land(B\\to A),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Var}_B(p)&\\coloneqq\\{p\\},\\quad\\mathrm{Var}_B(\\bot)\\coloneqq\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\mathrm{Var}_B(\\neg A)=\\mathrm{Var}_B(\\Box_iA)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Var}_B(A),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Var}_B(A\\land B)&\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Var}_B(A)\\cup\\mathrm{Var}_B(B),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Sub}_B(p)&\\coloneqq\\{p\\},\\quad\\mathrm{Sub}_B(\\bot)\\coloneqq\\{\\bot\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Sub}_B(\\neg A)&\\coloneqq\\{\\neg A\\}\\cup\\mathrm{Sub}_B(A),\\quad\n\\mathrm{Sub}_B(\\Box_iA)\\coloneqq\\{\\Box_iA\\}\\cup\\mathrm{Sub}_B(A),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Sub}_B(A\\land B)&\\coloneqq\\{A\\land B\\}\\cup\\mathrm{Sub}_B(A)\\cup\\mathrm{Sub}_B(B),\\\\\n\\widehat\\rho_B(p)&\\coloneqq\\rho(p),\\quad\\widehat\\rho_B(\\bot)\\coloneqq\\bot,\\quad\n\\widehat\\rho_B(\\neg A)\\coloneqq\\neg\\widehat\\rho_B(A),\\\\\n\\widehat\\rho_B(A\\land B)&\\coloneqq\\widehat\\rho_B(A)\\land\\widehat\\rho_B(B),\\quad\n\\widehat\\rho_B(\\Box_iA)\\coloneqq\\Box_i\\widehat\\rho_B(A),\\quad A[\\rho]\\coloneqq\\widehat\\rho_B(A),\\\\\ng_B(\\bot)&\\coloneqq0,\\quad g_B(p_i)\\coloneqq6i+1,\\quad g_B(\\neg A)\\coloneqq6g_B(A)+2,\\\\\ng_B(A\\land B)&\\coloneqq6\\pi(g_B(A),g_B(B))+3,\\quad\ng_B(\\Box_0A)\\coloneqq6g_B(A)+4,\\quad g_B(\\Box_1A)\\coloneqq6g_B(A)+5,\\\\\n\\operatorname{sort}_B(E)&\\coloneqq s\\quad(E\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathrm{Fml}_{0,1}),\\ s\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{0,1}^{<\\omega},\\\n\\operatorname{ran}(s)=E,\\ \\forall i<j<|s|\\ g_B(s_i)<g_B(s_j)),\\\\\n\\bigwedge\\langle\\rangle&\\coloneqq\\top,\\quad\\bigwedge(s\\mathbin{\\frown}\\langle A\\rangle)\\coloneqq(\\bigwedge s)\\land A,\\\\\n\\bigvee\\langle\\rangle&\\coloneqq\\bot,\\quad\\bigvee(s\\mathbin{\\frown}\\langle A\\rangle)\\coloneqq(\\bigvee s)\\lor A\\\\\n\\rho_{p,C}(q)&\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}C,&q=p,\\\\q,&q\\ne p,\\end{cases}\\quad(p,q\\in\\mathrm{Prop},\\ C\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{0,1}),\\\\\nA[p:=C]&\\coloneqq A[\\rho_{p,C}].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\Box","display":false},{"tex":"\\Box_0","display":false}],"bytes":3334,"backlinks":[{"id":"43a8d98c9b5fc94d","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"0fcc108fa2ae7636","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"cc6b2cfbdcc658df","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"e82c18eddcbe3ca2","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Var}_B$、双模态布尔宏及有限折叠取 [[89-df-bimodal-formula]]；$\\alpha,